{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/76ad7d78c455bd9d741eeb8aee11d0db.poster.avif?t=1771388218\" width=780 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/76ad7d78c455bd9d741eeb8aee11d0db.webm?t=1771388218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/76ad7d78c455bd9d741eeb8aee11d0db.mp4?t=1771388218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mech combat at a grand scale</strong>: From small skirmishes to epic battles. <strong>Combined arms combat</strong>\u00a0where you pilot any units under your command. Conquer rival empires as you build a stellar empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/f5e1b4899ecf022ce1c1ef9e5668e233.poster.avif?t=1771388218\" width=780 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/f5e1b4899ecf022ce1c1ef9e5668e233.webm?t=1771388218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/f5e1b4899ecf022ce1c1ef9e5668e233.mp4?t=1771388218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drop into combat</strong>. Either alone, leading your squad, or commanding an army.<strong> </strong>Customize the loadout for your Mech, Tank, VTOL, and Battle Armour to best suit the mission at hand.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/7f73de1b1b6e63b6e7d0bbcb95d7b99c.poster.avif?t=1771388218\" width=780 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/7f73de1b1b6e63b6e7d0bbcb95d7b99c.webm?t=1771388218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/7f73de1b1b6e63b6e7d0bbcb95d7b99c.mp4?t=1771388218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in the evolving battlefield, with <strong>fully destructible debris</strong> and unit wreckage. Train and upgrade your pilots as they gain experience. Build elite squads of battle hardened soldiers, or rush your opponent with disposable rookies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/01036d15a36d8df32ad679abee05deed.poster.avif?t=1771388218\" width=780 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/01036d15a36d8df32ad679abee05deed.webm?t=1771388218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/01036d15a36d8df32ad679abee05deed.mp4?t=1771388218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wage war across the star cluster in a procedural campaign. Face logistic and tactical decisions throughout the campaign as you vie for control of strategic resources, pivotal star systems, manufacturing hubs, and political objectives. Completed or failed mission objectives will have <strong>serious consequences</strong> as they impact future missions and campaign operations.</p>